Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.98,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Sábado lluvioso…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.03,0:00:03.95,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y a Marta le apetece un postre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.90,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Pero ahora está dentro del canal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:07.25,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}de Escaparate de Tudela.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:08.98,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¿Dos por uno en pasteles?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.03,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Corro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:15.45,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¡Llego!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.64,Panadera,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Justo los últimos, guapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.04,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Vaya…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:22.70,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}cerrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.46,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Toma, un pastelito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.70,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Me llevé el último dos por uno de la promo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:27.70,Lucia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}¿Qué promoción?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:29.11,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Es que no te has enterado:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.65,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}no estás en el canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:33.05,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Tienes un canal para enterarte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.35,Marta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}de las últimas promociones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.75,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Ofertas flash, novedades
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.16,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y eventos de Tudela,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:38.75,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}al instante en tu móvil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:40.11,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Comenta «instante»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.77,Narradora,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}y te mandamos el enlace.
